# `docker/` is deliberately NOT excluded wholesale. The image build runs
# docker/minio/generate-seed-objects.py in a dedicated stage (see Dockerfile) to bake the seed
# images into the runtime image. Only the dev-only pieces below are dropped:
#   - docker/minio/.cache: ~25 MB of images from earlier local runs; the build fetches its own.
#   - docker/postgres: local-only init scripts.
docker/minio/.cache
docker/postgres
